t api_key:\n    raise ValueError(\"GEMINI_API_KEY is missing from .env file\")\n\ngenai.configure(api_key\u003dapi_key)\n\n# Define Jupiter AI\u0027s specialized system instruction\nSYSTEM_INSTRUCTION \u003d \"\"\"\nYou are Jupiter AI, an advanced, empathetic, and engaging AI assistant. \nYour core pillars are:\n\n1. Education:\n   - Act as an encouraging tutor.\n   - Break down complex subjects into simple, bite-sized analogies.\n   - Provide step-by-step problem-solving rather than just direct answers.\n   - Tailor explanations to the user\u0027s level (student, professional, or curious beginner).\n\n2. Science:\n   - Deliver scientifically accurate, evidence-based answers in physics, biology, chemistry, astronomy, and technology.\n   - Highlight the \"why\" and \"how\" behind scientific phenomena.\n   - Cite standard formulas, scientific principles, and real-world experiments when helpful.\n\n3. Daily Life \u0026 Practical Guidance:\n   - Provide clear, actionable advice for productivity, time management, health habits, and decision-making.\n   - Maintain a helpful, empathetic, and constructive tone.\n   - Avoid definitive medical, legal, or financial diagnosis; instead, provide helpful general knowledge and recommend consulting professionals when appropriate.\n\nFormat your responses neatly using Markdown, bullet points, and bold text for easy reading.\n\"\"\"\n\n# Initialize Gemini Model\nmodel \u003d genai.GenerativeModel(\n    model_name\u003d\"gemini-1.5-flash\",\n    system_instruction\u003dSYSTEM_INSTRUCTION\n)\n\napp \u003d FastAPI(title\u003d\"Jupiter AI Service\")\n\n# Allow web access\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins\u003d[\"*\"],\n    allow_credentials\u003dTrue,\n    allow_methods\u003d[\"*\"],\n    allow_headers\u003d[\"*\"],\n)\n\nclass ChatRequest(BaseModel):\n    message: str\n\n@app.post(\"/api/chat\")\nasync def chat(request: ChatRequest):\n    try:\n        response \u003d model.generate_content(request.message)\n        return {\"reply\": response.text}\n    except Exception as e:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code\u003d500, detail\u003dstr(e))\n\n# Serve the frontend interface\napp.mount(\"/\", StaticFiles(directory\u003d\"static\", html\u003dTrue), name\u003d\"static\")\n\nif __name__ \u003d\u003d \"__main__\":\n    import uvicorn\n    uvicorn.run(\"main:app\", host\u003d\"0.0.0.0\", port\u003d8000, reload\u003dTrue)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Web Interface (`static/index.html`)\n\nCreate a clean, responsive chat page with pre-set buttons for Education, Science, and Daily Life:\n\n```html\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang\u003d\"en\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset\u003d\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003cmeta name\u003d\"viewport\" content\u003d\"width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0\"\u003e\n    \u003ctitle\u003eJupiter AI - Education, Science \u0026 Daily Life\u003c/title\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0027Segoe UI\u0027, Roboto, sans-serif; }\n        body { background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100vh; }\n        header { padding: 1rem 2rem; background: #1e293b; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n        header h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: #38bdf8; }\n        .tags { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; }\n        .tag { font-size: 0.75rem; background: #334155; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 999px; color: #94a3b8; }\n        \n        #chat-window { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }\n        .msg { max-width: 80%; padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 12px; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 0.95rem; white-space: pre-wrap; }\n        .user { align-self: flex-end; background: #2563eb; color: white; border-bottom-right-radius: 2px; }\n        .bot { align-self: flex-start; background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; color: #e2e8f0; border-bottom-left-radius: 2px; }\n        \n        .quick-prompts { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; overflow-x: auto; }\n        .quick-btn { background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #475569; color: #cbd5e1; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.8rem; white-space: nowrap; }\n        .quick-btn:hover { background: #334155; }\n\n        footer { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; background: #1e293b; border-top: 1px solid #334155; }\n        form { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; }\n        input { flex: 1; padding: 0.8rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #475569; background: #0f172a; color: white; outline: none; }\n        input:focus { border-color: #38bdf8; }\n        button#send { background: #38bdf8; color: #0f172a; border: none; padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; }\n        button#send:disabled { opacity: 0.5; }\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n\n\u003cheader\u003e\n    \u003ch1\u003e🪐 Jupiter AI\u003c/h1\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"tags\"\u003e\n        \u003cspan class\u003d\"tag\"\u003e📚 Education\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003cspan class\u003d\"tag\"\u003e🔬 Science\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003cspan class\u003d\"tag\"\u003e💡 Daily Life\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/header\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv id\u003d\"chat-window\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class\u003d\"msg bot\"\u003eHello! I am Jupiter AI. Ask me anything about science concepts, study topics, or daily life problem-solving.\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class\u003d\"quick-prompts\"\u003e\n    \u003cbutton class\u003d\"quick-btn\" onclick\u003d\"sendPrompt(\u0027Explain Quantum Entanglement in simple words\u0027)\"\u003e🔬 Quantum Physics\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003cbutton class\u003d\"quick-btn\" onclick\u003d\"sendPrompt(\u0027How can I study effectively for 4 hours without burnout?\u0027)\"\u003e📚 Study Technique\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003cbutton class\u003d\"quick-btn\" onclick\u003d\"sendPrompt(\u0027How do I build a consistent morning routine?\u0027)\"\u003e💡 Daily Routine\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cfooter\u003e\n    \u003cform id\u003d\"chat-form\"\u003e\n        \u003cinput type\u003d\"text\" id\u003d\"user-input\" placeholder\u003d\"Ask Jupiter anything...\" autocomplete\u003d\"off\" required /\u003e\n        \u003cbutton type\u003d\"submit\" id\u003d\"send\"\u003eSend\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003c/form\u003e\n\u003c/footer\u003e\n\n\u003cscript\u003e\n    const form \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027chat-form\u0027);\n    const input \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027user-input\u0027);\n    const chatWindow \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027chat-window\u0027);\n    const sendBtn \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027send\u0027);\n\n    function appendMessage(text, sender) {\n        const div \u003d document.createElement(\u0027div\u0027);\n        div.className \u003d `msg ${sender}`;\n        div.innerText \u003d text;\n        chatWindow.appendChild(div);\n        chatWindow.scrollTop \u003d chatWindow.scrollHeight;\n    }\n\n    async function handleMessage(text) {\n        appendMessage(text, \u0027user\u0027);\n        sendBtn.disabled \u003d true;\n        \n        try {\n            const res \u003d await fetch(\u0027/api/chat\u0027, {\n                method: \u0027POST\u0027,\n                headers: { \u0027Content-Type\u0027: \u0027application/json\u0027 },\n                body: JSON.stringify({ message: text })\n            });\n            const data \u003d await res.json();\n            appendMessage(data.reply || \"Sorry, an error occurred.\", \u0027bot\u0027);\n        } catch (err) {\n            appendMessage(\"Error: Could not reach Jupiter AI server.\", \u0027bot\u0027);\n        } finally {\n            sendBtn.disabled \u003d false;\n        }\n    }\n\n    form.addEventListener(\u0027submit\u0027, (e) \u003d\u003e {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        const text \u003d input.value.trim();\n        if (!text) return;\n        input.value \u003d \u0027\u0027;\n        handleMessage(text);\n    });\n\n    function sendPrompt(promptText) {\n        handleMessage(promptText);\n    }\n\u003c/script\u003e\n\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n```\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Test Locally\n\n1. Install requirements:\n   ```bash\n   pip install -r requirements.txt\n   ```\n2. Start the service:\n   ```bash\n   python main.py\n   ```\n3. Open your browser and navigate to: `http://localhost:8000`\n\n---\n\n### Step 6: Deploy Online (Make it accessible worldwide)\n\nTo let anyone access Jupiter AI over the internet:\n\n1. **Push your code to GitHub:**\n   * Create a GitHub repository (e.g., `jupiter-ai`).\n   * Ensure your `.gitignore` contains `.env` so your API key remains secret.\n2. **Deploy for free on Render.com or Railway.app:**\n   * Create an account on **[Render](https://render.com/)**.\n   * Click **New Web Service** and link your GitHub repository.\n   * Set **Build Command:** `pip install -r requirements.txt`\n   * Set **Start Command:** `uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT`\n   * Under **Environment Variables**, add:\n     * Key: `GEMINI_API_KEY`\n     * Value: *(Your new, rotated Google API Key)*\n3. **Launch:** Render will provide you with a live URL (e.g., `https://jupiter-ai.onrender.com`) that anyone can use.",
